[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7743.109, "timestamp": "02:09:03", "text": "曾经。那也很好。就像我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7745.35, "timestamp": "02:09:05", "text": "艺术家福克斯"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7753.83, "timestamp": "02:09:13", "text": "她觉得很好用。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7757.189, "timestamp": "02:09:17", "text": "但当她不得不把东西给我的时候"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7759.75, "timestamp": "02:09:19", "text": "比如文件之类的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7762.31, "timestamp": "02:09:22", "text": "真麻烦。是的，你得等一段时间。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7765.03, "timestamp": "02:09:25", "text": "很多。我喜欢坐在那里看着"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7767.43, "timestamp": "02:09:27", "text": "在这个文件中。好的，它正在增长。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7770.229, "timestamp": "02:09:30", "text": "生长。它正在增长。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7772.79, "timestamp": "02:09:32", "text": "就像我们把它当成一个闪烁的小玩意儿来用一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7781.109, "timestamp": "02:09:41", "text": "所以你们俩的网络都必须很好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7783.149, "timestamp": "02:09:43", "text": "否则文件将……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7786.87, "timestamp": "02:09:46", "text": "慢得像极了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7790.83, "timestamp": "02:09:50", "text": "哦，好像她非得给我这个似的。"}]